flowchart LR
  accTitle: CI/CD Pipeline
  accDescr: Application checks precede Docker delivery. The package is exported, verified, restored and tested. Publication is restricted to push or manual dispatch on main, with no public-cloud deployment.
  T["Triggers<br/>PR targeting main<br/>Push to main<br/>workflow_dispatch"]
  subgraph CI["Continuous integration — Application checks"]
    direction TB
    E["Ubuntu 24.04<br/>Python 3.13 · Node.js 22<br/>PostgreSQL 16 · CPU PyTorch<br/>Chromium and WebKit"]
    PY["Python checks<br/>unittest → Mypy<br/>PostgreSQL / YOLO integration"]
    FE["Frontend checks<br/>ESLint → TypeScript<br/>Production build"]
    BT["Browser tests<br/>Regression: includes simulated APIs<br/>Full-system: real application stack"]
    EV["Preserve test evidence<br/>Logs, versions and failure traces<br/>Upload when not cancelled"]
    E --> PY --> FE --> BT --> EV
  end
  subgraph CD["Automated delivery — Docker delivery"]
    direction TB
    BUILD["Ubuntu 24.04<br/>Build backend and frontend<br/>Fetch PostgreSQL image<br/>Test source stack"]
    PACK["Package tested images<br/>delivery.py package / docker save<br/>Compose, manifest and support files"]
    LOAD["Verify and restore<br/>SHA256SUMS → docker load<br/>Match image IDs to manifest"]
    TEST["Test restored stack<br/>Packaged Compose<br/>No rebuild / no pull"]
    PUB["Publish delivery artifact<br/>Only push or manual dispatch on main<br/>Retention: 7 days"]
    BUILD --> PACK --> LOAD --> TEST --> PUB
  end
  T --> CI
  CI -->|needs: checks| CD
  %% ci.yml cancels an earlier run for the same workflow and ref.
  %% Delivery validation logs are also uploaded when not cancelled.
